cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Bug-bounty rejection taxonomy: 113 logged submissions classified by triage outcome and earliest catchable gate"
abstract: >-
  A personal log of 113 rejected bug-bounty submissions, each classified by the
  triage outcome, the earliest gate that could have caught it before submission,
  the root-cause class, and what could have prevented it. 63 of 113 (55.8%) could
  have been stopped from the public record (the program's pages, its published
  audits and known issues, or its test suite); 9 more only by the author's own
  submission log. Rejections only: there is no positive class. The dataset
  carries no target dimension: no protocol, chain, ecosystem, date or severity is
  published.
type: dataset
